Yesterday morning, I woke up at five o'clock.
It is extremely hot in Mumbai right now.
Even yesterday morning, the heat was intense here.
The city's heat was too much for me.
So I decided to go to the hills for a single day.
I packed my own backpack.
I put my own water bottle and an umbrella in the backpack.
Then my neighbour Asha came there.
There was a water bottle in her hand too.
She asked, "Maya, where are you going?"
I said, "Today I am going to Lonavala."
Asha said, "It is very hot today, you take my water bottle too."
I said, "Thank you, but I have my own water bottle."
So I did not take her water bottle.
Then I put on my own scarf to go outside.
At seven o'clock, I boarded the bus to go to the railway station.
I was very excited for the one-day trip.
